cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "China Tier-3A International Medical Center (IMC) Directory & Cross-Border Medical Cost Benchmarks (2026)"
message: "If you use this dataset in research, journalism, policy analysis, or software, please cite it using the metadata below (CC-BY-4.0)."
type: dataset
version: "2026.11.0"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChinaMedVisit/china-tier3a-imc-healthcare-dataset"
url: "https://chinamedvisit.com/cost-calculator"
abstract: >-
  Structured cross-border healthcare benchmark dataset compiled by ChinaMedVisit
  covering 76 verified Chinese hospitals across 10 major cities (74 public Grade-3A
  International Medical Centers and 2 JCI-accredited private international hospitals),
  12 core clinical procedure out-of-pocket cost benchmarks comparing China Tier-3A IMC,
  China private international clinics, US self-pay averages, and UK private rates,
  4 ancillary medical-travel coordination items, 4 bundled multi-day care presets,
  24 frontier specialty clinical therapies across 8 specialties, and 12 specialty
  deep-dive comparison benchmarks.
